  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2501.12 “Prenote test” means a banking industry safeguard where a zero-dollar transaction is sent through the ACH network to verify the New Hampshire department of treasury’s routing/transit number and bank account number.\n\nSource. #6639, eff 11-27-97, EXPIRED 11-27-05\n\nNew. #8495, eff 11-30-05 (formerly Rev 2501.12); ss by #10484, eff 12-5-13 (from Rev 2501.12); ss by #10754, eff 1-1-15); ss by #13724, eff 8-18-23 (formerly Rev 2501.13) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 2500)",
